<div class="callout" style="margin-top: 24px;">
  <strong>Core Warning:</strong> Points are not immune to inflation. Airlines and hotels devalue their loyalty programs almost every year. We strongly recommend "Earn and Burn"—use your points as you earn them. Never treat points as a long-term investment.
